;
; A gathering Bonfire keeps, in MYRA (bonfire_rules.h BR4): its place in
; the model's list (3 digits), when it starts in seconds since 1970 (11
; digits), its seats (4), the people coming (4) and its venue, the place
; it meets at in place.list's order (3; -1 for none named). Bonfire keeps
; a gathering only when its values make a record.
^ZXBONFIRE(gathering:i3) = start:i11! ^ seats:i4! ^ going:i4! ^ venue:i3!
